From: hfatehi <trialoftheniku@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 01:35:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] C4F10 card calibrated on its own cell-averaged full sim
 (T06c); make_cards writes only the named cards

The C4F10 card no longer reuses the Xe calibration with a 1.11 factor from two different
standalone cells: N_sat, per-photon resolution, correlated term, yield scale, ring efficiency and
bending coefficient come from the same theta-uniform, PDE-sampled full sim with C4F10 in the ALFA
ARC. make_cards.py [Xe2bar] [C4F10] writes only the requested variants (the Xe card is unchanged).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KP5vqAGH2XiGXWtPhaonke
